      "content": "## Nexus-7 Proximity Sensor Quick Start Guide\n\n**I. Component Overview**\n*   **Power Requirements:** Operates on 5V DC.\n*   **Physical Installation:** Secure mounting is achieved via M3 screw holes located at each corner.\n\n**II. Electrical Connection Guide**\n*   **Pinout Configuration:**\n    *   Pin 1: VCC (Power Input)\n    *   Pin 2: GND (Ground Reference)\n    *   Pin 3: Signal Output\n    *   Pin 4: Shielding Connection\n\n**III. Operational Procedures**\n*   **Initial Calibration Sequence:** Allow a mandatory 3-second idle period immediately following power-up before initiating any functional tests.\n*   **Environmental Safety Precautions:** Strictly avoid exposure to any liquid media or ambient temperatures exceeding 50°C.",
